Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Graduation's coming up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't been taking\Nyour stuff home, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.45,0:00:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, I'll help out.\NShow me what you wanna keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--And throw all those papers out!\N--Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--And throw all those papers out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori's acting like Yoshikawa's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, you sure\Nhave a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are such pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to take\Nstuff home every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a free hand, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--Could ya help me out here, Hori?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arms are so {\i1}strong{\i0}, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.79,0:01:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Hori-san, you had\Nthis much crap piled up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}these guys {\i0}did!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Take all personal belongings home today!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}these guys {\i0}did!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Take all personal belongings home today!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you have like, no stuff at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you have like, no stuff at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? 'Cause I was a good boy\Nand took it home every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"{\i1}Iura {\i0}was doing his job\Nand you guys {\i1}weren't{\i0}?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? 'Cause I was a good boy\Nand took it home every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"{\i1}Iura {\i0}was doing his job\Nand you guys {\i1}weren't{\i0}?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Hori-san.\NDon't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Hori-san.\NDon't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got this CD!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?! This must've been one\NI forgot to give back to you. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap, yeah, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I have\Nsome DVDs I borrowed off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there goes my sweet,\Nlight-handed commute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have way more\Nthan all of us, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of us stronger guys could\Nhelp you carry it down to the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me, Ishikawa, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He means you're so dependable, Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't mean anything insulting by it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I Would Gift You The Sky"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I Would Gift You The Sky"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi, could you get the trash...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi, could you get the trash...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Fun Spring Trips!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Fun Spring Trips!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's distracted again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She's distracted again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you reading? A travel mag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna go see a big herd of giraffes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun, Yanagin!\NYou wanna go to the zoo, too, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one? The same one as before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is pretty far away.\NWe'd have to make it a two-day trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.75,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd need a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can go if we get a car and a hotel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't encourage her, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to make her\Nthink this might actually happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--She's such a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Okay, mom.\N--She's such a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A car, though... Sure\Nwould be nice to have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We could get to way more places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get my license.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a car, I could take you anywhere\Nyou wanted, Remi, not just that zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh. Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this isn't about going\Nto the zoo, but something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go buy a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:04:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? What's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't know unless you tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab her, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell us what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't let us help you,\Nthen you're going to force my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show Yanagi-kun what you look\Nlike with your cheeks all stretched out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,K-K-Kono-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, do it! Get it over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayasaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What on Earth is going on?!\NIs this something you do often?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly you can't force\Nher to talk like... like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, her cheeks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kono-san, Ayasaki-san\Ncan't talk like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun, please make her stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good, long look. You don't\Nget to see her like this that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. That felt nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's not bothering me or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:06:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just figured we could go somewhere\Nfun while we're still in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But as soon as you talked\Nabout getting a license,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized he could use it\Nto go really far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or he could just use it\Nto do everyday errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Getting a car = going away???"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Or he could just use it\Nto do everyday errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Getting a car = going away???"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Fun Spring Outings"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Fun Spring Outings"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we don't have to go\Nto the zoo or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we don't have to go\Nto the zoo or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry.\NWe'll be friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? You won't treat me like\Na stranger the second you graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all. That'd be a lot\Nof effort on our part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get my license, would you\Nall like to go on a road trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds nice. Where would we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Let's go to the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you fond of the ocean, Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I wanna go to the ocean, too!\NWe can go swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't swim. I just\Nwant to see the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's what we'll\Ndo after graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the zoo, too, Yanagin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get your\Nlicense, too, Ayasaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I call shotgun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair, Remi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth to Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She's fast asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense after carrying\Nall that heavy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess she just wanted a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She's frowning in her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She makes that face a lot, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.33,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, you're going to end up\Nwith wrinkles on your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She eats a lot, moves a lot,\Nand sleeps a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope these days never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If that tiny happenstance\Nhadn't occurred...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are our graduation essays due\Non the last day of school?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, I totally forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They took our graduation\Npicture super long ago, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I look like in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--I was next to a guy\NI'd never spoken to before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ishikawa! Let's head home!\N--I was next to a guy\NI'd never spoken to before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--Ishikawa! Let's head home!\N--It was totally awkward. I don't\Neven remember if I said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the same class, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna go to karaoke today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd your sister do on that exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof. That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sengoku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just in the student council room...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you finish cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sakura, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked so much better with long hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so unfriendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Remi! Don't rush me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! You know that shop\Nyou told us about before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, no, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking my stuff home is such a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, taking my stuff home is such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've brought it home ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've just brought it home ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--All students, please head home\Nso the all-staff meeting may begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Kyoko-chan! Let's go!\N--All students, please head home\Nso the all-staff meeting may begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah, I'm coming.\N--All students, please head home\Nso the all-staff meeting may begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a whole 'nother\Nweek until graduation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it'll be warmer for graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that guy?!\NHe was a mega hottie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where? He a third year?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I didn't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, someone's still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This was on the floor.\NLooks like an earring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell? What a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My high school days feel like\Nthey amounted to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all hypothetical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there's no point considering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't hypothetical for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay? What's got you all spaced out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So many coincidences brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What would it be like if\None of them didn't happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the fact that we're here\Ntogether now is the work of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was never completely\Nunfathomable, but it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here with them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the "fate" you\Nmentioned doesn't really exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the world would slowly but surely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,move in the direction I want it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"63rd Graduation Ceremony"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"63rd Graduation Ceremony"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the farewell address from our\Ngraduating student representative,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Graduation"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the farewell address from our\Ngraduating student representative,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Graduation"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakeru Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakeru Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Spring is upon us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--That dummy!\N--Spring is upon us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.37,0:13:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and so, too, is the graduation day for\Nthe 63rd class of Katagiri High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All graduating students,\Nplease return to your classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun, you little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I didn't do it on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice sneeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.91,0:13:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was {\i1}not nice{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot, I lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, dude, should the graduating student\Nspeaker be sprinting through the halls?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice speech, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So what were you chasing Miyamura for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you {\i1}think {\i0}I was chasing him for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta apologize to him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice day out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They found out about the\Npiercings. And my tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a lot of friends,\Nplus a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't pretend\Nyou're not there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll disappear for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats on graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! C'mon, Miyamura,\Nwe're gonna take a class photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hurry back, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind's so strong today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, where the hell is our class?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Photo Duty"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, where the hell is our class?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, where the hell is our class?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, let's take a picture together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, well, okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to take\Npictures of {\i1}all {\i0}of us, Yasuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I take pictures of guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grab a snapshot of you\Nwith my eyes. There, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! This is a big life moment!\NGet a picture of us, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sad I won't get to see you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You can still come over to see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too often, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well let her have it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our last day, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Remi, have you seen her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ayasaki? No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh-- Sorry, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun this year. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I had the best time of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and part of that was\Nbecause of you, Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you, Ishikawa-kun.\NAnd I like Yoshikawa-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Same. Neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care. See you again soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess she's trying to leave\Nher feelings behind at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"BA-DUMP"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Congratulations on graduating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Congratulations on graduating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you graduated, too! Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I needed to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"BA-DUMP"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to go somewhere\Nwith everyone after graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:17:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean as a group?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We had this conversation\Nwith the student council the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me think, once I get my license...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us best buds could travel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--We'll take Miyamura-kun,\NHori-san, Kono-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--Best buds.\N--We'll take Miyamura-kun,\NHori-san, Kono-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.45,0:18:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Just the same as always.\N--We'll take Miyamura-kun,\NHori-san, Kono-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.45,0:18:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds great! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for offering to drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's going to change after\Ngraduation, and if it does, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll still be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's my special boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyosuke-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that Miyamura-kun's dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so young!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They look so similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Similar {\i1}how{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna get a picture\Nwith my wonderful kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let me get Hori-san--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you here, Dad?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to have Dad fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here before someone\Nsees you in this ridiculous outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura! Where's {\i1}your {\i0}mom and dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They were here for a bit,\Nbut had to head home for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, why you gotta be so mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,C-C'mon, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You serious, Iura?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead serious, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moto, you came?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--Whoa, is this your little sister?\N--Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.54,0:19:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Whoa, is this your little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You come to pick your big brother up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom said she wanted you home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus I figured I could see what\Nmy new school would be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,God, that ceremony was so long!\NWhy'd they talk so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey, let's get\Nour butts home, Moto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all, folks! Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to see Iura peppy till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All's right with the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:19:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go get sushi, wanna come?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet! Let's head out, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyosuke's gonna be so thrilled,\Nlike, annoyingly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no distance between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been this\Nclose to a person before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no boundary between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to be terrified of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared of this, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that I could feel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.87,0:20:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so many different emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think either of us knew
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.29,0:20:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,how scary or nerve-wracking being\Nyourself around others could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But you made me realize all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I make you smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so much stronger\Nthan I think you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.87,0:21:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're so much weaker\Nthan I feel you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why wherever you go,\Nbright, sunny days follow after.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For years, the only person\NI knew this well was myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew a world\Nlike this even existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for shattering my reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for wanting a future with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do for {\i1}you{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I repay you for what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.95,0:22:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The spring sky is bluer\Nthan I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could gift you\Nthis wonderful sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I know what you'd like better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A cake with lots of whipped cream on top.
